WEBVTT

00:00:00.104 --> 00:00:05.743
Setting up class fees

00:00:05.793 --> 00:00:13.057
Open Finance, then Fee Setup. The Monthly Structure tab shows the monthly fee of each class.

00:00:14.305 --> 00:00:19.089
Choose By Class, then press Edit on the class you want to change.

00:00:20.372 --> 00:00:26.346
Change the amount for the fee category. Charges can be added or removed here too.

00:00:27.308 --> 00:00:31.376
Press Review and Save to check the new total before it is saved.

00:00:33.710 --> 00:00:39.269
Press Confirm and Save. Fee records you generate later use this amount.

00:00:42.422 --> 00:00:47.090
Class fee updated
